Package: stcolrm
Type: Package 
Title: Calculating standardised coefficients for logistic regression models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
  given = "Asaduzzaman", 
  family = "Md", 
  role = c("aut","cre"), 
  email = "asad.mdaz@gmail.com")
Published: 2025-09-01
Description: `stcolrm` is an R package designed to compute standardised coefficients for logistic regression models. It provides a straightforward and statistically sound method to assess the relative importance of predictors by rescaling them to a common scale. This allows for more interpretable comparisons between covariates in binary outcome models. The package uses glm()-fitted logistic regression objects, calculates standardised beta coefficients, and help visualising effect sizes.
